  "description": "Introducing the effervescent Neon on Black Checkered Pattern Pack, boasting an electric fusion of luminous hues against a stark black background. This set is ideal for giving an energy shot to home décor projects, infusing vibrant charisma to paper crafts or digitizing your scrapbooking escapades. It’s a perfect accompaniment to your summer party decorations, lending a pop of color and zing. Enrich your tote bags, fabric prints, notebooks, and journals with this arresting patterned delight. Experience a new way of gift-giving by wrapping your heartfelt gifts in this spectacularly designed paper. So much more than a simple graphic, this neon and black checkered pattern pack injects life, color and brightness wherever you put it to use.\n– 300 dpi\n– JPG\n– 3600 x 3600 px\n– 12 files\n– Zipped",
